{%- comment -%}
  Renders the diamond glyph used on the brand values strip.

  Drawn to the Phase 2 contract - 24x24 canvas, stroke 1.5,
  currentColor, round caps and joins. Traced from the prototype's own raster
  at brand-assets/images/icon-diamond.png, which PHASE-2:1417 lists as one of
  the four value glyphs the prototype supplied as PNG. Raster cannot follow
  currentColor, a hover or a surface, which is why it is redrawn here.

  Accepts:
  - class: {String} optional extra class names

  Usage:
  {% render 'icon-diamond', class: 'icon--xl' %}

  Decorative: the tile's title and subtitle carry the meaning, so the mark is
  aria-hidden and the tile needs no alternative text.
{%- endcomment -%}
<svg class="icon icon--diamond {{ class }}" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6.75 3.75h10.5L21 9.5 12 20.5 3 9.5Z"/><path d="M3 9.5h18"/><path d="m6.75 3.75 2.75 5.75L12 20.5"/><path d="m17.25 3.75-2.75 5.75L12 20.5"/></svg>
